{"id":"dcf7f68e-c95a-4c45-800a-9bfda4fb35e4","title":"Glow Up 3","slug":"glow-up-3","collectionSlug":"glow-up","collectionName":"Glow Up","category":"logo","categoryZh":"文字特效","description":"Four rounded-square glass morphism cards arranged in a cross/diamond pattern against a pure black background. The bottom-left card glows with a bright lime-green to pale yellow gradient, creating the brightest element in the composition. The top-left card displays a soft green-to-white gradient with a subtle glow. The top-center card features a cyan-to-light-blue gradient with smooth color transitions. The right card shows a white-to-dark-blue gradient with a pronounced blue tint. Each card has a frosted glass effect with a 20-pixel blur radius, creating a translucent, luminous appearance. The cards exhibit chromatic aberration and iridescent thin-film interference effects, producing subtle color shifts along their edges. A soft glow halo extends outward from each card with varying intensity (size 200px at 0.01 opacity and size 100px at 0.04 opacity), creating a diffuse light bloom effect. The overall atmosphere is modern, sleek, and ethereal, with a dark mode aesthetic emphasizing the luminous quality of the glass elements. The color wheel animation creates dynamic gradients cycling through cyan, lime-green, and blue hues. The composition has a centered, symmetrical layout with subtle depth created by the glass refraction and fresnel effects.","colors":["#b3ffbc","#2376fc","#7fff08","#b3e5ff"],"labels":["gradient","glowing","3d","dark"],"cover":"/shaders/covers/dcf7f68e-c95a-4c45-800a-9bfda4fb35e4.jpg","toneMapping":"aces","components":[{"type":"SolidColor","id":"idmpvn3723fw3xrsit4","_key":"key_1780344400251_0.8118029531307341","props":{"color":"#0a0a0a","opacity":1,"maskType":"alpha","blendMode":"normal","transform":{"edges":"transparent","scale":1,"anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"offsetX":0,"offsetY":0,"rotation":0}}},{"type":"Glass","id":"idmpvn3723r74474m1i","_key":"key_178034